WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.676
Welcome to APEX DEV. In this teacher workshop, you will turn a real school challenge into a working web app.

2
00:00:07.226 --> 00:00:11.850
Here is the roadmap. Before we meet, define one real problem in Pre-work.

3
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:19.322
During the workshop, try AI-assisted coding, write a focused plan, build your app, and share it with colleagues.

4
00:00:19.872 --> 00:00:24.806
Your posts, plans, and finished work are recorded in APEX DEV as you go.

5
00:00:25.356 --> 00:00:29.117
You will take away a web app that can help address the problem you chose.

6
00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:32.669
To begin, select Get started on the first screen.

7
00:00:33.219 --> 00:00:38.842
Enter your real name as your nickname. Add your email address and a password of at least eight characters.

8
00:00:39.392 --> 00:00:45.021
Select Create account. When the account-ready message appears, continue to the workshop space.

9
00:00:45.571 --> 00:00:52.515
On Home, select Submit pre-work. This guide uses a sample preview; your real post is saved after signing in.

10
00:00:53.065 --> 00:00:57.438
The Pre-work page has two posted examples. Select a card to read one.

11
00:00:57.988 --> 00:01:02.074
You can open Guide for more help. When you're ready, select New post.

12
00:01:02.624 --> 00:01:06.496
The assignment guide is on the left. Build your own statement on the right.

13
00:01:07.046 --> 00:01:13.475
Start with who: which people experience the problem? For example, teachers who share school spaces.

14
00:01:14.025 --> 00:01:20.489
For task, describe what they are trying to do. For situation, explain when or where the problem happens.

15
00:01:21.039 --> 00:01:27.491
For root cause, explain why it keeps happening. Keep names and sensitive student details out of your post.

16
00:01:28.041 --> 00:01:32.165
As you fill in the four boxes, Your statement appears automatically below.

17
00:01:32.715 --> 00:01:37.048
Read the complete sentence. You can adjust the wording directly in Your statement.

18
00:01:37.598 --> 00:01:42.480
Then select Publish post. Your problem statement appears on the shared Pre-work board.

19
00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:48.249
That's all you need to do before we meet. We'll build and share the web app together during the workshop.

20
00:01:50.083 --> 00:01:51.883
See you soon in Seoul!
